<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: gestate hyrax -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.label>组装蹄兔</DMS_Make_Hyrax.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a hyrax Automatroid, an unmanned vehicle mounting a remote weapon station on a light tracked chassis. Simple automatic weapons like this one are usually the first practical drone system any arms manufacturer ships.\n\nThe tracked chassis keeps it from being slowed when it is attacked in melee, it draws half the power of a comparable mech, and on days with no firefight it will work as a hauler. In exchange it is structurally fragile and slow on the move. Use it for reconnaissance by fire in built-up terrain, or as a garrison unit at a base. -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.description>组装蹄兔，一种以轻型履带底盘搭载遥控机枪塔的无人载具。这类构造简单的自动武器通常是各家军火商开发的第一件实用无人机系统。\n\n履带底盘使其受到近战攻击时不会因此减速，动力消耗仅为同级机兵的一半，没有交火的日子还能充当搬运工。代价是脆弱的结构强度、以及缓慢的行进速度。适合在巷战中执行火力侦查或者用于基地驻防。</DMS_Make_Hyrax.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Hyrax.jobString>

  <!-- EN: gestate falcon -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.label>组装游隼</DMS_Make_Falcon.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Falcon Automatroid, a light tri-rotor aircraft built for armed aerial reconnaissance and anti-armor strikes. Its low production cost and modest bandwidth demand make it the cheapest forward scouting firepower a mechanitor can field.\n\nIt flies over terrain no ground unit can cross, moves at roughly twice the pace of a ground mech, and can carry a disposable anti-tank launcher, letting it destroy targets far above its own weight class. It has almost no plating and very little structure behind it, and its armament is limited to light firearms and thrown ordnance. -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.description>组装游隼，一种轻型三旋翼飞行器，用于空中武装侦察与反装甲打击。低廉的造价与不高的控制带宽使它成为机械师手上最便宜的前沿侦查火力。\n\n它能飞越地面单位无法通过的地形，速度约为地面机兵的两倍，并能够挂载抛弃式反坦克发射器得以击毁远超其吨位的目标。但它几乎没有装甲，结构也极为单薄，武装也仅限于轻型枪械与投掷物。</DMS_Make_Falcon.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Falcon.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Noctula -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.label>组装夜蝠</DMS_Make_Noctula.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Noctula Automatroid, the command-relay conversion of the Falcon. The weight freed by stripping its weapon hardpoints goes into an optical camouflage module and a relay antenna, letting it hover behind the enemy line and hold the command chain open for hunters and forward detachments.\n\nAt rest it is all but transparent to observation, and it extends a mechanitor's control envelope out beyond the local map. The cost is a higher bandwidth demand and a limited ability to carry weapons. -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.description>组装夜蝠，游隼的指令中继改装型。拆除武器挂架所腾出的重量被用于安装光学匿踪模组与中继天线，使它能够在敌方阵线后方悬停，为猎兵与前沿分队维持指挥链。\n\n它在静止时对观测近乎透明，并能将机械师的控制范围向外延伸至本地地图之外。代价是较高的带宽需求以及有限的武器携带能力。</DMS_Make_Noctula.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Noctula.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Dogge -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.label>组装獒犬</DMS_Make_Dogge.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Dogge Automatroid, a four-legged machine gun platform. The synthetic muscle bundles in its limbs give it uncommon cross-country mobility, and its low profile suits it to providing accompanying fire across open ground - it is usually used to mop up routed enemies and for counter-guerrilla work.\n\nIt keeps both an auto-engaging fixed machine gun turret and a separate weapon hardpoint that will take a flamethrower for close work, and it moves fast enough to keep pace with any advance. Culturing the synthetic muscle is expensive, its plating only handles fragments and small calibers, and the hardpoint will not accept a long-barrelled weapon. The Dogge is well suited to running down fast-moving light guerrillas and escaping prisoners, and it can also carry anti-tank rockets to punch above its weight in street fighting. -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.description>组装獒犬，一种四足机枪平台。四肢中的人工肌肉束赋予它罕见的越野机动力，而低矮的车身轮廓使其擅长在开阔地带提供伴随火力，通常被用于清剿溃散的敌军与反游击作战。\n\n它同时保有一座自动接战的固定机枪塔与一个独立武器挂点，可换装喷火器执行近距离作业，其移动速度也足以跟上任何一次推进。但人工肌肉的培养成本高昂，其装甲仅足以应付破片与小口径弹，挂点亦无法容纳长管枪械。獒犬适合用来追击高机动性的轻装游击队与逃跑的囚犯，但也可以携带反坦克火箭弹来在巷战中以小博大。</DMS_Make_Dogge.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Dogge.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Soldat -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.label>组装士兵</DMS_Make_Soldat.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Soldat Automatroid, a mass-produced bipedal humanoid built to fight alongside armored units on the main line. Its value is not individual performance but compatibility with the supply system that already exists.\n\nIt occupies only a single point of bandwidth, its external battery pack keeps its power draw below comparable mechs, and it can take over the operation of some fixed machine gun positions. The Soldat is poorly protected against blunt trauma and walks slowly, which leaves it very vulnerable when caught in the open. -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.description>组装士兵型机兵，一种双足人形量产机体，用于在正面战场上与装甲单位协同作战。它的价值不在单机性能，而在于对既有补给体系的兼容性。\n\n它仅占一点控制带宽，外挂电池背包使其耗电低于同级机体，并能接手操作部分固定机枪阵地。士兵型的钝击防护薄弱、步行速度缓慢，因此暴露在开阔地十分脆弱。</DMS_Make_Soldat.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Soldat.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Grenadier -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.label>组装掷弹兵</DMS_Make_Grenadier.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Grenadier Automatroid, the indirect-fire control variant of the Soldat. Its fire control unit has been recalibrated to compute ballistic arcs, letting it operate grenade launchers, thrown ordnance and mortar mounts, and handle targets behind cover that direct fire cannot reach.\n\nIt is the most efficient mass-produced platform for clearing fortified positions and demolishing structures, and it carries a built-in flash launcher for suppression. In exchange it demands tungsteel and synthetic fabric to build, costs two points of bandwidth, and defends itself badly at direct range; it also inherits the Soldat's thin plating and exposed battery pack. Indirect fire does not distinguish friend from foe - deploy it behind your own units. -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.description>组装掷弹兵，士兵型的曲射火控增强型号。其射控单元经过重新标定以计算抛物线弹道，使它能够操作各式榴弹发射器、投掷物与迫击砲座，专门处理躲在掩体后方、直射火力构不着的目标。\n\n它是清理工事阵地与破坏建筑最有效率的量产机体，并内建闪光发射器用于压制。代价是需要钨钢与合成纤维的高昂造价、两点控制带宽，以及贫弱的直射自卫能力；它同样沿用了士兵型的薄装甲与外露电池背包。曲射武器不分敌我——请将它部署在己方部队后方。</DMS_Make_Grenadier.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Grenadier.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Sergeant -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.label>组装军士</DMS_Make_Sergeant.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Sergeant Automatroid, the relay-command conversion of the Soldat, recognizable by the dish-shaped omnidirectional radar and transceiver mast on its back. Its job is to organize scattered units into a combined automatroid battlegroup (CAB), and to hold the command chain open on behalf of the mechanitor when they cannot move up in person.\n\nIts relay radius far exceeds the Noctula's and extends control into neighboring maps, and the identification code on its T/R transceiver can be used to request Soldat and Falcon reinforcement drops from synchronous orbit. The mass and processing load of the radar assembly cost four times the Soldat's bandwidth, however, and leave it slower, thinner-skinned, and able to carry nothing heavier than a sidearm for self-defense. When a Sergeant is destroyed, every link in the command chain it was holding open goes down with it. -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>组装军士机兵，士兵型的中继指挥改装型，特征是背负的碟形全向雷达与收发天线。它的职责是把分散的机体编组成混成机兵战斗集群(CAB)，并在机械师本人无法前推时代为维持指挥链。\n\n它的中继半径远大于夜蝠，能将控制范围延伸至邻近地图，并可凭T/R收发器上的辨识代码向同步轨道请求士兵型与游隼的空投增援。但雷达组件的重量与运算需求使其占用四倍于士兵型的控制带宽，行动更慢、装甲更薄，且只能携带手枪自卫。军士被击毁时，它所维系的整条指挥链会一并中断。</DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.jobString>组装机械体中</DMS_Make_Sergeant.jobString>

</LanguageData>
